<li><p><strong>Advanced:</strong>
<a href="howto/outputting-csv/"><span>Generating CSV</span></a> |
<a href="howto/outputting-pdf/"><span>Generating PDF</span></a></p></li>
<li><p><strong>Middleware:</strong>
<a href="topics/http/middleware/"><span>Overview</span></a> |
<a href="ref/middleware/"><span>Built-in middleware classes</span></a></p></li>
